# J-003 — Template for /home/ps/.quantmind.env (NEVER commit to git).
#
# The systemd unit (deploy/quantmind.service) reads this file via
# EnvironmentFile=. The install script (scripts/install_quantmind_service.sh)
# can render a starting template here, but the owner is responsible for
# filling in the secrets — typically by sourcing them from ~/.bashrc.
#
# Permissions: chmod 600 + chown quantmind:quantmind (the install script
# enforces this). The systemd unit mounts the file ReadOnlyPaths= so
# the running backend cannot mutate or leak the file content beyond the
# process's loaded env.
#
# Red lines (P1-6 §1.1 / CLAUDE.md §2.9):
#
# * NEVER place LLM provider keys (DEEPSEEK_API_KEY / DASHSCOPE_API_KEY /
#   MOONSHOT_API_KEY) or FEISHU_* credentials inside the repository's
#   /home/ps/papers/QuantMind/.env — secrets_validator will SystemExit
#   on any assignment-form line for those names. Move them here.
# * The legacy FEISHU_CUSTOM_BOT_* variables are FORBIDDEN per
#   P0-2-amendment-2026-05-16 (owner tenant disabled custom-bot
#   globally). Their presence triggers a SYSTEM_INTERRUPTED audit
#   warning at startup.
#
# Per-section defaults below — uncomment + fill before activating the
# systemd unit.

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. LLM provider credentials (P1-6 §1.1 — required for every run mode)
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=sk-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# DASHSCOPE_API_KEY=sk-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# MOONSHOT_API_KEY=sk-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Feishu credentials (required iff FEISHU_INTERACTIVE_ENABLED=true)
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# FEISHU_INTERACTIVE_ENABLED=false
# FEISHU_APP_ID=cli_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# FEISHU_APP_SECRET=xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# FEISHU_VERIFY_TOKEN=xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# FEISHU_ENCRYPT_KEY=xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# FEISHU_ALERT_CHAT_ID=oc_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# FEISHU_DECISION_CHAT_ID=oc_yyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyy

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. Storage backends (defaults assume local quanttmind user owns mongod + redis)
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# MONGODB_URI=mongodb://localhost:27017/quantmind
# MONGODB_DATABASE=quantmind
# REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379/0

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. J-007 production gate — set BOTH when activating I-002 long-run
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# QUANTMIND_PROD_RUN=1
# QUANTMIND_OWNER_PROD_AUTHORIZATION=owner_id:YYYYMMDD

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 5. Optional dev/CI hooks
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# QUANTMIND_LLM_STUB=0
# QUANTMIND_BROKER_SKIP_RS_GATE=0
# LOG_LEVEL=INFO
# LOG_AUDIT_PATH=/home/ps/papers/QuantMind/logs/audit.jsonl
